        "title": "Release Notes",
        "excerpt":"Release Notes   IDA   26.0.10 - 05/10/2026   Enhancements     [Comparison] Missing file content compare result.   [Comparison] Display test suite name ordered by test suite name, display suite start time in print report.   [Pipeline] Add server status check in pipeline dashboard page.   [Pipeline] Enable webhooks from BAW Push To Git to IDA pipeline.   [Administration] Able to transfer shared resources by team when removing a user.   Bug Fixes     [Comparison] The attached to node of Error Boundary Event is not shown in comparison result of Service Flow and Client-side Human Service.   [Comparison] Missing comparison results for process gateways - Decisions in General tab and Decisions tab props.   [Plugin] Should not clear required field \"Track\" value if click \"Load Snapshots\" in COMPARISON tab in WebPD.   Notes     There are database changes from 26.0.1 to 26.0.10, please use the Migrate Database Schema page to execute migration scripts.   IDA supports Spring Framework v6 based on Java 17 or Spring Framework v5 based on Java 8.   26.0.6 - 06/30/2026   Enhancements     [Checkstyle] Detect External Service calls within a Service Flow where there is no associated exception handling.   [Checkstyle] Synchronize the Checkstyle BOM models with the latest XOM models.   [Pipeline] Display the deployment response message(status description) associated with the deployment status when hovering over status icons.   Bug Fixes     [Comparison] Remove Boundary Event(Tracking) from comparison result.   [Security] Fix security issues and upgrade libs in IDA codebase.   Notes     IDA supports Spring Framework v6 based on Java 17 or Spring Framework v5 based on Java 8. To install IDA on Java 17, please check doc in Installing IDA Application on Java 17(https://sdc-china.github.io/IDA-doc/installation/installation-installing-ida-application-java17.html).   The checkstyle rules change details  [Added rules]     /checks/service/check-service-item-using-external-service-without-exception-handling(This rule is disabled by default; if you need to use it, please enable it in Checkstyle Rules Configuration.)   Release Components                  Component Description       Release File                       IDA release package for traditional web server based on Java 8(eg: Liberty, WebSphere)       ida-26.0.6-java8.zip                 IDA release package for traditional web server based on Java 17(eg: Liberty)       ida-26.0.6-java17.zip                 IDA web and operator docker images based on Java 17       ida-26.0.6-java17.tgz           IDA Supporting Subscription Service  1-year standard support is provided for each major release after its official release date. It’s only available with IDA Supporting Subscription Service.   Previous Releases   Here you can find a more complete list of release notes.  ","categories": ["installation"],
        "tags": [],
